msgid "Module for managing cadence workflows and runtime activity sequences."
msgstr "Modul untuk mengelola alur kerja irama dan urutan aktivitas runtime."

msgid ""
"Standardized exception chaining in cadence forms to preserve root-cause "
"tracebacks."
msgstr ""
"Rangkaian pengecualian standar dalam bentuk irama untuk mempertahankan "
"penelusuran balik penyebab utama."

msgid ""
"Migrated signal and timezone imports to the horilla shims, standardized "
"first-party import groups, and added class and method docstrings for pylint "
"compliance."
msgstr ""
"Impor sinyal dan zona waktu yang dimigrasikan ke shim horilla, grup impor "
"pihak pertama yang terstandarisasi, dan penambahan dokumen kelas dan metode "
"untuk kepatuhan pylint."

msgid ""
"Cadence forms aligned with HorillaModelForm layout: field_order, Meta.fields"
" = \"__all__\", Meta.exclude, and keep_on_form; save logic and HTMX "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Formulir irama selaras dengan tata letak HorillaModelForm: field_order, "
"Meta.fields = \"__all__\", Meta.exclude, dan keep_on_form;simpan logika dan "
"HTML tidak berubah."

msgid ""
"Release 1.10: cadences ship under contrib with app label cadences. Signals, "
"registrations, URLs, and static paths updated to match the new contrib "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"Rilis 1.10: irama dikirimkan di bawah kontrib dengan irama label "
"aplikasi.Sinyal, pendaftaran, URL, dan jalur statis diperbarui agar sesuai "
"dengan tata letak kontribusi yang baru."

msgid ""
"Implemented cadence signals for runtime activities, enabling automated "
"cadence-driven workflow execution and activity tracking."
msgstr ""
"Menerapkan sinyal irama untuk aktivitas runtime, memungkinkan eksekusi alur "
"kerja dan pelacakan aktivitas berbasis irama otomatis."

